{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51056","headline":"书与胡咏之 · 吕岩","name":"书与胡咏之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"济世应须不世才，调羹重见用盐梅。\n种成白璧人何处，熟了黄粱梦未回。\n相府旧开延士阁，武夷新筑望仙台。\n青鸡唱彻函关晓，好卷游帏归去来。\n（见《宋诗纪事》卷九十引《墨庄漫录》。\n）（见《墨庄漫录》卷一，云爲元符初胡咏之在信州弋阳县见道人所题诗，时人推测此道人「必爲吕翁」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}